---

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-content">
    <h2 class="cta-headline">
      Wanna work together?<br />
      Let's get in touch and chat.
    </h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">
      Or reach out directly to <a href="mailto:hi@jackygrob.com" class="cta-email">hi@salinash.studio</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-grid">
    <div class="footer-col">
      <span class="footer-label">/CONTENT</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/legal">Legal notice</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <span class="footer-label">/SOCIAL</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.behance.net/jackygrob" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Behance</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackygrob" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.xing.com/profile/Jaqueline_Grob" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Xing</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <span class="footer-label">/REALISATION</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://nesim.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nesim (Development)</a></li>
        <li><span>Marie Grob (Photography)</span></li>
        <li><a href="/">Jaqueline Grob (Design)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <span class="footer-label">/ABOUT</span>
      <p class="footer-about-text">
        Jaqueline Grob is a designer focussing on digital experiences and visual identities located in Potsdam, Germany.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    background-color: var(--color-dark);
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: 5rem 1.25rem 6rem;
  }

  .cta-content {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .cta-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
  }

  .cta-email {
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-email:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .site-footer {
    background-color: var(--color-dark);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 2.5rem;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .footer-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gray-700);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .footer-col ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }

  .footer-col a,
  .footer-col span {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-white);
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .footer-about-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
